# Rust
/target
**/*.rs.bk
# `Cargo.lock` is committed (workspace ships a binary `rayd-cli`, so the
# Rust convention applies). CI runs `cargo test --locked` to verify a
# fresh build resolves to the exact same dep set developers see locally.

